<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Premier Laser rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Premier Laser rated buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rodman &amp; Renshaw Inc said it initiated coverage of Premier Laser Systems Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Premier Laser is a leading medical laser technology company with a product focus that we believe is unique in its depth and breadth,&quot; Rodman said in a report issued Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Premier closed Tuesday at 10-13/16.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
